     A****************************************************************
     A** A/R Detail - Sort Order Work File
     A**
     A**    This file will use a newly created field DTSORT to arrange
     A**     the data in the order selected from A/R Detail prompt
     A**     screen. (W7380R)
     A**
     A****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PDT01                     TEXT('A/R DETAIL - AGENT WORK FILE')
     A            DTCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            DTFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            DTAGT#    R               REFFLD(AGT#)
     A                                      COLHDG('AGENT #' 'ASSIGNED BY FUND')
     A            DTPROD    R               REFFLD(AGT#)
     A                                      COLHDG('PRODUCER NUMBER')
     A            DTEMP#    R               REFFLD(EMP#)
     A            DTDIV     R               REFFLD(DIV)
     A            DTSTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A            DTUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            DTPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            DTTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A            DTDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTAINED')
     A            DTSORT    R               REFFLD(DS30)
     A                                      COLHDG('SORT FIELD')
